>
  ## Vulnerability Management
  Every generated file is audited for security injection risks, hardcoded secrets, and module mismatches prior to repository commit.

  ## Credential Protection
  API keys and tokens are masked before entering LLM model context windows.

  ## Sandboxed Execution
  Build and test checks take place in non-root container sandboxes.
